   "text": "Long ago, there were three goats named Big, Middle, and Small. Like all goats, they loved grass, and they were always hungry for more. One day, Small said, \"Look over there, across the river!\" The goats looked. They saw a big, green hill. \"That hill is so green!\" said Middle. \"It must be covered with tasty grass.\" \"That grass will make a fine lunch,\" said Big. \"Let's go there now!\"",
