   "text": "Small went first. As he trotted across the bridge, his small feet made a small sound. Trip-trap. Trip-trap. Trip-trap. The troll woke up. \"Who is crossing my bridge?\" he yelled. \"It's only me!\" said Small. \"I want some fresh grass to eat. Please let me go across.\" \"No one may cross!\" cried the troll. \"If you try, I will gobble you up!\" The little goat stopped to think.",
