   "text": "\"Please don't do that,\" said Small. \"I am very small and thin. Wait for my sister. She is bigger. You will find her much more tasty.\" \"Well,\" said the troll. \"All right then. Now run away before I change my mind!\" So Small ran across the bridge. Next came Middle. As she trotted across the bridge, her middle-sized feet made a middle-sized sound. TRIP-trap. TRIP-trap. TRIP-trap. \"Who is crossing my bridge?\" yelled the troll. \"It's only me!\" said the goat. \"I want some fresh grass to eat. Please let me go across.\"",
