   "text": "\"No one may cross!\" cried the troll. \"If you try to cross my bridge, I will gobble you up!\" \"Please don't do that,\" said Middle. \"Wait for my brother. He is very big, and he will make a much more tasty meal.\" \"Well,\" said the troll. \"All right then. Now run away before I change my mind!\" So Middle ran across the bridge. Then came Big. As he trotted across the bridge, his very big feet made a very big sound. TRIP-TRAP. TRIP-TRAP. TRIP-TRAP. \"Who is crossing my bridge?\" yelled the troll. \"It's only me!\" said the goat. \"I want some fresh grass to eat. Please let me go across.\"",
